Package: ontologyDiscoverR
Title: AI-Assisted Ontology Discovery from Documents and Schemas
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("ontologyDiscoverR", "Authors", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "authors@example.com")
Description: Uses large language models to extract ontology structure (object types,
    properties, link types, actions, concepts) from database schemas, API specs,
    documentation, and data files. Produces a structured bundle as a plain R list
    that can be used standalone or passed to downstream ontology packages.
Depends: R (>= 4.1)
Imports:
    httr2,
    jsonlite,
    rlang,
    cli,
    purrr,
    dplyr
